# React Product Architecture

A collection of **production-grade React architecture patterns** built with:

* React
* TypeScript
* TailwindCSS
* Modern testing patterns
* Accessibility best practices
* Performance optimization techniques

This repository serves as a **living reference of frontend architecture patterns used in real-world production systems**.

The goal is to demonstrate **how senior and staff-level frontend engineers design scalable React applications**, not just build components.

---

# Why This Repository Exists

Most React tutorials focus on **features**.

Real production systems require much more:

• predictable architecture
• reusable patterns
• strong typing
• performance awareness
• accessibility
• testing strategy
• maintainable abstractions

This repo demonstrates **how those concerns are solved in production-grade React applications.**

---

# Tech Stack

Core technologies used throughout the repository:

* **React 18+**
* **TypeScript**
* **TailwindCSS**
* **TanStack Query**
* **React Hook Form**
* **Zod**
* **MSW (Mock Service Worker)**
* **Jest / React Testing Library**
* **Playwright**
* **Framer Motion**
* **Vite**

